    <!-- Export -->
    <string name="export_on_device_privacy">Everything runs entirely on your phone — no audio or video is ever sent to the cloud. Your content stays completely private. Processing time depends on your device\'s hardware, so it may take several minutes. Other apps offload this to powerful servers; we keep it on your device instead. Worth the wait!</string>
